{
  "quikchat-backend/.env.example": "- File Path: `quikchat-backend/.env.example`\n- High-Level Purpose: Provides an example file for environment variables required to configure the QuikChat backend application.\n- Definitions in the File:\n  - This is a configuration example file and does not contain code definitions.\n- Notable Patterns or Logic:\n  - Configuration Example: Lists common environment variables for server port, database URL, Redis address, JWT secret key, and JWT token expiry durations.",
